{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1544709-everybody-needs-some-body","id":1544709,"title":"Everybody Needs Some Body","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Curseborne"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-25T00:22:20-07:00","id":1544709,"title":"Everybody Needs Some Body","content":"So since bodies the Dead occupy continue to decay what\u2019s the rate of corpse turnover? Do they decay at the normal rate and in the normal way? If they use magic to heal their body does it \u201cfreshen them up\u201d a bit? When they inhabit an \u201cempty\u201d living body can they keep it alive and for how long? These are the questions that keep me up during the day when I should be sleeping.<br /> <br /> Assuming they rot like a normal body that would pretty quickly become noticeable and fairly quickly become impossible to conceal. Rigor mortis can start as soon as four hours after death and settling of the blood starts even sooner. Even if they don\u2019t have mechanical problems piloting their new body around that seems like it\u2019ll be a social issue pretty fast.<br /> <br /> I admit I like the idea of their spiritual presence warding off or slowing down the process to some extent. Maybe make it a nuisance thing except that it doesn\u2019t heal on its own and that wear and tear builds up.<br /> <br /> I also like the idea of living bodies being able to stay alive while the Dead inhabit them but maybe the Dead aren\u2019t as good at taking care of them. They forget to eat and drink, they don\u2019t realize the reason they keep tripping is because they haven\u2019t slept in days, etc. it also makes them a hot commodity and explains why you\u2019re supposed to talk with your elders about sourcing your next ride.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13508-necrobotany","name":"necrobotany","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-25T03:31:22-07:00","id":1544714,"title":"","content":"The book is inconsistent on this. Chapter 3 says the Dead continue to decay but the Dead chapter says they don't. At least one AP run by Matthew (who should know the canon) has a Dead PC who is still in his original body after 80 years.<br /> <br /> There are a fair few things that need clearing up about the Dead. The rules say they can inhabit non-corpse bodies but it isn't clear if they need spells to do this and if so how they fulfil the &quot;keep it for 24 hours&quot; criterion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T02:20:48-08:00","id":1545288,"title":"","content":"The impression I get is it works like, of all things, DEATH BECOMES HER.<br /> <br /> The bodies continue to take damage and wear and tear but they are unaging. So eventually you'll have to find a new body because the lifestyle of an Accursed is not one where you don't run yourself down.<br /> <br /> Too many things out to eat you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T02:26:13-08:00","id":1545290,"title":"","content":"I agree that's the impression I get but chapter three directly contradicts it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28625-nobody-special","name":"Nobody Special","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-11-04T02:40:34-08:00","id":1545292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcod